{"symbol":"DNLM.L","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:06:42Z","info":{"address1":"Dunelm Store Support Centre","address2":"Watermead Business Park Leicester","city":"Syston","zip":"LE7 1AD","country":"United Kingdom","phone":"44 11 6264 4400","website":"https://www.dunelm.com","industry":"Specialty Retail","industryKey":"specialty-retail","industryDisp":"Specialty Retail","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","sectorKey":"consumer-cyclical","sectorDisp":"Consumer Cyclical","longBusinessSummary":"Dunelm Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the retail of homewares in the United Kingdom and Ireland. The company offers furniture and beds products, such as bedroom, living room, dining room, and other furniture, as well as sofas and armchairs; and bedding products comprising bed linen, duvets, pillows, protectors, dorma, and baby and kids bedding products. It also provides home decors, including wall art and decor, flowers and plants, ornaments, vases, mirrors, photo and picture frames, decorative trays and bowls, candles and home fragrance, clocks, fireplace accessories, curtains, rugs, cushions, throws, bean bags, housewarming gifts, engagement and wedding gifts, anniversary gifts, personalized gifts, and gift cards. In addition, the company offers roller, roman, venetian, vertical, shutters, Perfect Fit, cordless, kitchen, bathroom, children, and door blinds; ceiling lights, table and bedside lamps, lamp shades, floor lamps, wall lights, rechargeable lighting, bathroom lighting, string lights, outdoor lighting, LED lighting, chandeliers, lamp bases, and tripod lights; and light bulbs, pendant flex cables, electrical and wiring accessories, and light switches. Further, it provides christmas and autumn products; cooking, dining, electricals, utilities, and pet products; bath products; decorating and DIY products; storage products; and kids products. Additionally, the company offers specialist services, such as made-to-measure curtains and Pausa cafes. The company sells its products through stores and online store. The company was founded in 1979 and is based in Syston, the United Kingdom.","fullTimeEmployees":11567,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Clodagh  Moriarty","age":46,"title":"CEO & Director","yearBorn":1979,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":5367412,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Sir William Lester Adderley","age":53,"title":"Executive Deputy Chairman","yearBorn":1972,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":21000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Karen  Witts F.C.A.","age":62,"title":"CFO & Director","yearBorn":1963,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":786000,"exercisedValue":205366,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. William  Adderley","age":76,"title":"Founder & Life President","yearBorn":1949,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":21000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. John  Gahagan","title":"Chief Technology & Transformation Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Luisa Ann Wright","age":47,"title":"Company Secretary & General Counsel","yearBorn":1978,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Amanda Jane Cox","age":56,"title":"Stores & People Director","yearBorn":1969,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Laura Louise Harricks","age":45,"title":"Chief Customer Officer","yearBorn":1980,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Faye  Atkins","title":"Chief Commercial Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":2,"boardRisk":2,"compensationRisk":5,"shareHolderRightsRisk":9,"overallRisk":2,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1798675200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":899.5,"open":905,"dayLow":896,"dayHigh":909,"regularMarketPreviousClose":899.5,"regularMarketOpen":9